WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.869
Vinnie took the photo out of his pocket.

2
00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:15.274
"I think it's almost time for us to go home," he said.

3
00:00:15.275 --> 00:00:18.458
Vinnie pointed to the glowing object.

4
00:00:18.459 --> 00:00:20.874
It was glowing blue.

5
00:00:20.875 --> 00:00:22.639
"But what is it?"

6
00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:26.214
asked Mandy, looking at the photo.

7
00:00:26.215 --> 00:00:29.082
"They are coming," said Magua.

8
00:00:29.083 --> 00:00:31.615
He pointed to the village gate.

9
00:00:31.616 --> 00:00:35.766
A long line of chiefs slowly walked in.

10
00:00:35.767 --> 00:00:39.081
Each wore his traditional headdress.

11
00:00:39.082 --> 00:00:43.936
Mandy was amazed by their colorful clothes.

12
00:00:43.937 --> 00:00:47.546
"Should we hide?" whispered Mandy.

13
00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:49.831
But it was too late.

14
00:00:49.832 --> 00:00:54.164
One of the chiefs stopped when he saw the children.

15
00:00:54.165 --> 00:00:58.272
"The enemy stands on our land," he said.

16
00:00:58.273 --> 00:01:00.599
Vinnie gulped loudly.

17
00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:04.736
Mandy felt tears in her eyes.

18
00:01:04.737 --> 00:01:09.231
"We are a peaceful people," Clan Mother said.

19
00:01:09.232 --> 00:01:13.351
"Remember Hiawatha's wampum belt."

20
00:01:13.352 --> 00:01:20.001
"Yes, it is the belt of harmony among the Iroquois," the chief said to Clan Mother.

21
00:01:20.002 --> 00:01:22.523
"But not harmony with the whites!"

22
00:01:22.524 --> 00:01:25.139
He pointed to Vinnie and Mandy.

23
00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:30.823
"These children have done no harm to us," said Clan Mother.

24
00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:34.907
"What is a wampum belt?" whispered Vinnie.

25
00:01:34.908 --> 00:01:39.276
"A wampum belt is made of small beads made from shells.

26
00:01:39.277 --> 00:01:44.075
It is very important for the Iroquois," explained Magua.

27
00:01:44.076 --> 00:01:50.631
"Hiawatha's belt was made long ago when the Five Nations was first formed."

28
00:01:50.632 --> 00:01:56.012
Respectfully, Magua and Onatah came up to the chief.

29
00:01:56.013 --> 00:01:58.530
"It is true," they said.

30
00:01:58.531 --> 00:02:01.903
"Vinnie and Mandy came in peace."

31
00:02:01.904 --> 00:02:07.700
Vinnie and Mandy were very moved by the words of their new friends.

32
00:02:07.701 --> 00:02:10.759
"They're trying to help us, Vinnie,"

33
00:02:10.760 --> 00:02:14.010
said Mandy, wiping her eyes.

34
00:02:14.011 --> 00:02:18.540
"Very well. The children may stay," said the chief.

35
00:02:18.541 --> 00:02:21.733
Onatah walked back to Mandy and Vinnie.

36
00:02:21.734 --> 00:02:24.749
Magua stood behind the chief.

37
00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:30.635
It took a very long time for all the chiefs to gather around the fire.

38
00:02:30.636 --> 00:02:35.414
"Sorrow has come to our people," one of the chiefs said.

39
00:02:35.415 --> 00:02:40.601
"There is a time for peace and a time for battle," said another.

40
00:02:40.602 --> 00:02:46.610
"Oh, Vinnie," whispered Mandy, "there's going to be war."

41
00:02:46.611 --> 00:02:51.424
"The Iroquois will not be divided," said another chief.

42
00:02:51.425 --> 00:02:54.358
"We must stand strong against the whites."

43
00:02:54.359 --> 00:02:59.279
He held up a purple and white belt in both hands.

44
00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:02.345
"Wow!" cried Vinnie.

45
00:03:02.346 --> 00:03:04.869
"That's Hiawatha's belt!

46
00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:08.011
It's the one Magua told me about."

47
00:03:08.012 --> 00:03:12.753
The belt was decorated with white and purple shells.

48
00:03:12.754 --> 00:03:17.865
"The Great Tree of Peace is in the center of it," said Onatah.

49
00:03:17.866 --> 00:03:24.000
"And the row of white shells is like a path for anyone who seeks peace."

50
00:03:24.001 --> 00:03:27.674
"The Iroquois want peace," the chief said.

51
00:03:27.675 --> 00:03:31.337
"But if we must fight, we will fight as one people!"

52
00:03:31.338 --> 00:03:35.066
Everyone cheered.

53
00:03:35.067 --> 00:03:40.541
"Vinnie! The photo! The wampum belt!" cried Mandy.

54
00:03:40.542 --> 00:03:45.497
Sure enough, the belt in the photo was glowing red.

55
00:03:45.498 --> 00:03:48.556
Mandy looked around for her friend.

56
00:03:48.557 --> 00:03:53.022
But Onatah had disappeared into the crowd.

57
00:03:53.023 --> 00:03:54.695
"Come on, Mandy,"

58
00:03:54.696 --> 00:04:00.271
Vinnie said, gently taking his sister's hand.

59
00:04:00.272 --> 00:04:06.034
They fell down the dark tunnel.

60
00:04:06.035 --> 00:04:08.818
The children opened their eyes.

61
00:04:08.819 --> 00:04:11.029
They were in the attic.

62
00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:20.328
At that moment, Dad opened the door.
